 (st stmt)←prepareExtractedStatementChecked args ;_con;extracted;index;count
⍝ Prepare extracted statement with explicit bounds check.
⍝ args: (connection extracted index count)
⍝ returns: (duckdb_state prepared_statement_ptr)

 (_con extracted index count)←args
 :If index≥count
     st←DuckDBError
     stmt←0
     →0
 :EndIf

 (st stmt)←api.duckdb_prepare_extracted_statement _con extracted index 0

